cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ZMO AI Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Google Colab workflows for research transcription, OCR/HTR, and
  source-grounded summaries with the Gemini API. Every completed result carries a
  provenance sidecar recording the source hash, fixed model release, exact prompt,
  helper hash, settings, finish reasons, and token counts.
